						<li>A reservation is considered confirmed only after you sign the hotel booking form through your account.</li>
						<li>You will receive a confirmation email, and your reservation details will be available in your account.</li>
						<li>Once you sign the hotel booking form, you will also have the option to download a copy of the signed form directly from your account.</li>
